WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
After a tooth is taken out: Bite on the gauze for about 30 minutes

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
After a tooth is taken out: No straws, spitting or smoking for 2 days

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
After a tooth is taken out: Call the clinic if bleeding doesn't settle
